<title>USA: MBIA has limited capacity in Puerto Rico Common..</title>
<headline>MBIA has limited capacity in Puerto Rico Common..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp on Tuesday said it has limited capacity in Puerto Rico Commonwealth GOs, Puerto Rico and Puerto Rico Aqueduct and Sewer Authority on a first-come first serve basis. Please call 1-800-MBIA-NOW. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
